      "biography": {
        "value": "<p>The Eldritch Cannon of an Artillerist: a Small or Tiny magical object. Its Hit Points equal five times your Artificer level, and casting Mending on it restores 2d6 Hit Points to it. You activate it with the activities of your Eldritch Cannon feature (Flamethrower, Force Ballista, or Protector).</p>",
